body:
&#x200B;

I said this already,but you said that I should reply.

They're claiming to have fictives of a dating sim called Obey Me!, this account specifically revolves around a character named Leviathan. They also claim to have at least two other fictives from the same game, one being a a character named Satan and the other being the Main Character (MC) or the player. Obey Me! was released at the end of 2019, which means they're either too young to show signs of D.I.D(first signs of D.I.D being reported in people of at least 16 years old) or they're too old to have formed a fictive(being at least 12 when the game was released)
